EVALUATION.md §1, CODEGEN.md §4.2, §5.6, DECISIONS 312, 385: a dependent map of optional values in a data loader's class is DependentOutsideField alone (the loader cannot bind its parameter), reported once at the field; gen/go holds optional map values.
-- a/a.canon --
package a

/// A status.
record S {
  /// Label.
  label: String
}

/// The statuses.
let statuses: table S = {
  open { label: "Open" }
}

/// A rate.
record Rate(s: S) {
  /// Value.
  value: Int
}

/// Rates.
record Rates {
  /// By status.
  byStatus: {s in statuses: Rate(s)?}
}

/// The rates.
let rates: Rates = { byStatus: { open: { value: 1 } } }

emit go { out: "@features/a", package: "a", mode: data }
emit json { out: "out/" }
-- findings.txt --
error[E8019]  a/a.canon:23:3
  emit go in data mode cannot generate a dependent value outside a record field (in a map, a literal union, or a value or result of its own); hold the value in a record field beside its discriminant

1 error, 0 warnings in 1 package (…)
